      "caption": "12 Days of Maulid 🌙 | Day 9–12\n\nAssalamualaikum wr. wb., blessed jemaah! 🌹\n\nAs we enter the final stretch of our 12 Days of Maulid, here are the Maulid groups and invited asatizah who will be joining us for Day 9 to Day 12.\n\nJoin us daily for:\n🌹 After Maghrib — Recitation of Maulid\n🎙️ After Isya’ — Tazkirah by our invited asatizah\n\nMay we make the most of these final evenings together, increasing our selawat and deepening our love for our beloved Prophet Muhammad ﷺ.\n\nShould you wish to sponsor a Maulid slot, you may do so here:\nhttps://form.jotform.com/Assyafaah_Mosque/maulid-sponsorship\n\nSee you there, insyaAllah! 🤍",
